# Trajectory cache (#63). NEVER commit these: tenant.jsonl holds tenant-scoped
# rows by design, so a committed cache file is a privacy incident, and the
# append-only history means one bad line is permanent. The file names are
# matched anywhere, not just under .cache/, because the store takes an explicit
# directory and a caller can point it somewhere else.
.cache/
pool.jsonl
tenant.jsonl
